      "offsetInSection": 4384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200010000201010009002E002E002E0020004D0061006900730020006200690065006E0020007300FB007200200021000A004A0065002000760069007300750061006C0069007300650020006C00650020006400E90063006F00720020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Troisième Pokémon ! Lequel est de\ntype Ténèbres ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
